'''Vinegar''' is a cooking ingredient that can be used in a variety of recipes. It can be purchased for {{Price|200}} at [[Pierre's General Store]]. It can also be purchased from [[George]]'s [[Desert Festival#Villager Shops|shop]] at the [[Desert Festival]] for {{Price|5|Calico}} [[Calico Egg]]s. Two Vinegar can also be made by putting [[Rice]] into a [[Keg]].

When used on a [[Trees|tree]], it prevents the tree from growing [[Moss]].

